                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Text="v9.0.0 | Cloud Sync, Clan 2.0, Wipe Tracker &amp; Genetics 2.0" FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,8" Foreground="{DynamicResource Accent}"/>
                                    <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,10" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextBodyBrush}">
                                        Milestone release featuring Clan 2.0 with accurate banner rendering, native in-process FCM listener, Player Wipe Tracker with cloud sync, Genetics Lab 2.0 with ultra-fast solver &amp; camera OCR, and native CCTV camera engine with analog joystick.
