                                    <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                        <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; In-Game Banner Colors &amp; Showcase:</Run>
                                        Accurately renders all 8 in-game cloth banner colors with 270x170px showcase cards.
                                    </TextBlock>
                                    <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                        <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Ultra-Fast Genetics Solver (24x-40x Faster):</Run>
                                        Rewritten solver with bit-packed genotypes, zero-allocation pruning, and phone camera OCR scanning.
